   "date": "2017-03-28T11:59:02Z",
   "subject": "from_to for repeated simulation",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello, <div><br></div><div>I am new to using simmer for DES (coming from the world of Simul8). This is a great tool and thanks for all the hard work you&#39;ve put in. I normally use these programs for healthcare simulation and have a question about simulating different patient arrival times throughout the day. </div><div><br></div><div>Is there currently a way to run a simulation for (as an example) 5 days, where patients would arrive at different rates between 3 different periods in the day. Such as</div><div><br></div><div>1 patient every 10 mins from 8am to 4pm</div><div>1 patient every 30 mins from 4pm to 12am</div><div>1 patient every 60 mins from 12am to 8am</div><div><br></div><div>I got the general idea to work fine using the code below (defining different patient types, though if there is a simpler way to do this, then I&#39;m happy to take on suggestions), but then if I wanted to simulate this over 5 days, is there a way to reset the clock at minute 1440 (midnight) on day one, so that I don&#39;t need to define 15 different groups of patients?  </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>simmer() %&gt;%<br></div><div>    </div><div>    ...</div><div><br></div><div>    add_generator(&quot;patient_on_&quot;, patient_traj, from_to(0, 8*24, function() rexp(1, rate = 1/60), arrive = F), mon = 2) %&gt;% <br></div><div><div>    add_generator(&quot;patient_am_&quot;, patient_traj, from_to(8*24, 16*60, function() rexp(1, rate = 1/15), arrive = F), mon = 2) %&gt;% <br></div></div><div><div>    add_generator(&quot;patient_pm_&quot;, patient_traj, from_to(16*60, 24*60, function() rexp(1, rate = 1/15), arrive = F), mon = 2) %&gt;% <br></div></div><div>  <br></div><div>    run(60*24*5)</div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hRLaEykXAgAJ",
   "from": "Iñaki Úcar",
   "author": "0f5b7adb7e70bd8b",
   "date": "2017-03-28T14:53:04Z",
   "subject": "Re: [simmer-devel] from_to for repeated simulation",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Hi,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Try this one:</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248)\">from_to &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>(start_time, stop_time, dist, arrive=<span>TRUE</span>, every=<span>NULL</span>) {\r\n  stopifnot(is.null(every) || every &gt;= stop_time)\r\n  started &lt;- <span>FALSE</span>\r\n  init &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">0</span>\r\n  counter &lt;- <span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">0</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">function</span>() {\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">while</span> (<span>TRUE</span>){\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">if</span> (!started) {\r\n        started &lt;&lt;- <span>TRUE</span>\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">if</span> (arrive) {\r\n          dt &lt;- start_time - init\r\n        } <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">else</span> {\r\n          dt &lt;- dist()\r\n          dt[<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>] &lt;- dt[<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>] + start_time - init\r\n        }\r\n      } <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">else</span> {\r\n        dt &lt;- dist()\r\n      }\r\n      len &lt;- length(dt)\r\n      dt &lt;- dt[cumsum(dt) + counter &lt; stop_time]\r\n      counter &lt;&lt;- counter + sum(dt)\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">if</span> (len == length(dt))\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">return</span>(dt)\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">if</span> (is.null(every))\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">return</span>(c(dt, -<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">1</span>))\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">if</span> (length(dt))\r\n        <span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-weight:bold\">return</span>(dt)\r\n      start_time &lt;&lt;- start_time + every\r\n      stop_time &lt;&lt;- stop_time + every\r\n      started &lt;&lt;- <span>FALSE</span>\r\n      init &lt;&lt;- counter\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">with <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">every=24*60</code>. If it works correctly, we can update this convenience function and it will be available in the next release.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Regards,<br>Iñaki</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGksPGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5UcnkgdGhpcyBvbmU6PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+\r\nPGRpdj5gYGByPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48ZGl2PmZyb21fdG8gJmx0Oy0gZnVuY3Rpb24oc3RhcnRfdGlt\r\nZSwgc3RvcF90aW1lLCBkaXN0LCBhcnJpdmU9VFJVRSwgZXZlcnk9TlVMTCkgezwvZGl2PjxkaXY+\r\nJm5ic3A7IHN0b3BpZm5vdChpcy5udWxsKGV2ZXJ5KSB8fCBldmVyeSAmZ3Q7PSBzdG9wX3RpbWUp\r\nPC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgc3RhcnRlZCAmbHQ7LSBGQUxTRTwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Jm5ic3A7IGlu\r\naXQgJmx0Oy0gMDwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Jm5ic3A7IGNvdW50ZXIgJmx0Oy0gMDwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Jm5i\r\nc3A7IGZ1bmN0aW9uKCkgezwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Jm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyB3aGlsZSAoVFJVRSl7PC9k\r\naXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyBpZiAoIXN0YXJ0ZWQpIHs8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PiZu\r\nYnNw